{
	"Version":"6.8.5.0",
	"Title":"8i.图表在分组-数据来自本身数据包",
	"Author":"锐浪报表软件",
	"Description":"将图表定义在分组中，图表数据来自本身的数据包：\r\n1、图表会在分组中多次显示生成，每次生成根据分组依据字段对图表记录集数据进行筛选。\r\n2、图表记录集上需要定义与分组依据字段同名的字段，这样才能进行数据筛选，这样才能保证每个分组项上的图表是显示对应的数据。\r\n\r\n明细记录集取数SQL：\r\nselect c.Region,c.City,c.CompanyName,t.CategoryName,sum(d.Quantity*d.UnitPrice) as Amount\r\nfrom (Orders m inner join \r\n(OrderDetails d inner join \r\n(Products p inner join Categories t on p.CategoryID=t.CategoryID)\r\non P.ProductID=D.ProductID) on m.OrderId=d.OrderId)\r\nleft join Customers c on c.CustomerID=m.CustomerID\r\nwhere m.OrderDate between #1/1/1997# and #12/31/1997#\r\ngroup by c.Region,c.City,c.CompanyName,t.CategoryName\r\norder by c.Region,c.City,c.CompanyName,t.CategoryName\r\n\r\n图表记录集取数SQL：\r\nselect c.Region,t.CategoryName,Month(m.OrderDate) As _Month,sum(d.Quantity*d.UnitPrice) as Amount\r\nfrom (Orders m inner join \r\n(OrderDetails d inner join \r\n(Products p inner join Categories t on p.CategoryID=t.CategoryID)\r\non P.ProductID=D.ProductID) on m.OrderId=d.OrderId)\r\nleft join Customers c on c.CustomerID=m.CustomerID\r\nwhere m.OrderDate between #1/1/1997# and #12/31/1997#\r\ngroup by c.Region,t.CategoryName,Month(m.OrderDate)\r\norder by c.Region,t.CategoryName,Month(m.OrderDate)\r\n",
	"Font":{
		"Name":"宋体",
		"Size":105000,
		"Weight":400,
		"Charset":134
	},
	"ConnectionString":"xml",
	"QuerySQL":"8i-data.txt",
	"Printer":{
	},
